<header class="fq-header" data-microfeed-site-nav>
  <div class="fq-header-inner">
    <div class="fq-header-left">
      {{! Site title: an Admin-configured override (Settings > Site) wins;
          microfeed falls back to the channel title, so this key is always
          populated. novel-cms keeps the two decoupled so the header can read
          星河剑歌 while the channel keeps its own name. }}
      <a class="fq-logo" href="/" aria-label="{{site_title}} 首页">
        <span class="fq-logo-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="fq-logo-text">{{site_title}}</span>
      </a>

      {{! The nav is data-driven: every visible backend category
          (内经类 / 本草 / 伤寒 / …), then any custom navigation page. Each
          category link lands on /category/<id>/, which lists only that
          category's books. There is deliberately no 首页 entry — the logo above
          is the way home, so a second link to `/` would just duplicate it.
          The prototype's 书库 / 书架 / 原创榜 placeholders are gone. }}
      <nav class="fq-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
        {{#category_nav}}
        <a href="/category/{{id}}/" rel="tag"{{#active}} class="active"{{/active}}>{{name}}</a>
        {{/category_nav}}
        {{#navigation_pages}}
        <a href="{{url}}" data-microfeed-nav-item>{{navigation_label}}</a>
        {{/navigation_pages}}
      </nav>
    </div>

    {{! 搜索、登录 / 注册入口按站点要求从头顶移除（2026-10-13）：本站是纯只读的
        公开阅读站，读者不需要它们，而它们会把头部挤成两行。搜索页 /search/ 仍
        可通过直接 URL 访问；后台 /admin/ 也不缺入口。剩下的 `fq-header-right`
        只有颜色主题切换。 }}
    <div class="fq-header-right">
      <div class="mf-theme-menu" data-microfeed-theme-menu>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="mf-theme-trigger"
          aria-label="颜色主题：浅色"
          aria-haspopup="menu"
          aria-expanded="false"
          data-microfeed-theme-trigger
        >
          <svg class="mf-theme-trigger-icon" data-microfeed-theme-icon="system" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M8 22h8M12 18v4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2"/>
          </svg>
          <svg class="mf-theme-trigger-icon" data-microfeed-theme-icon="light" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2"/>
          </svg>
          <svg class="mf-theme-trigger-icon" data-microfeed-theme-icon="dark" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20">
            <path d="M20.5 14.2A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.8 3.5 8.5 8.5 0 1 0 20.5 14.2Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="mf-theme-menu-panel" role="menu" aria-label="颜色主题" hidden>
          <div class="mf-theme-menu-label">颜色主题</div>
          <button type="button" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="false" data-microfeed-theme-option="system">
            <span>跟随系统</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="true" data-microfeed-theme-option="light">
            <span>浅色</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="false" data-microfeed-theme-option="dark">
            <span>深色</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
